# Schema change protection

Schema changes require:

- migration plan (toolchain, not ad-hoc prod DDL)
- rollback strategy
- compatibility analysis
- data safety assessment

Never auto-run destructive schema changes. Use `/builder-schema` to design migration and rollback first, then require explicit prod confirmation before any destructive execution.
